				FAQs❓I  Academic Calendar 📅 I Opening Hours 🕒
			</h2></header></div><div id="c63296" class="frame frame-default frame-default frame-type-textmedia frame-has-images top-level fmb-small"><div class="ce-textpic ce-center ce-above"><div class="ce-bodytext"><ul><li><a href="/international/exchange-students-from-partner-institutions/faq" class="internal-link" title="Öffnet internen Link im aktuellen Fenster"><strong>FAQ</strong></a><strong>:</strong> For any questions that may occur please check our Frequently Asked Questions – Section. If you cannot find the proper answer to your question, do not hesitate to contact us!</li><li>Check our the <a href="/international/tips-and-experiences"><strong>tips and experiences</strong></a>&nbsp;of former exchange students at LUBS!&nbsp;</li></ul><figure class="table fig-width" style="float:left;max-width:466.1pt;"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="contenttable"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color:#9e3a38;border-color:windowtext;height:13pt;width:466.1pt;" colspan="2"><strong>International Office Opening Hours</strong></td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#f2dbdb;border-bottom-color:currentColor;border-left-color:windowtext;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:10.4pt;width:254.25pt;"><strong>Monday</strong></td><td style="background-color:#f2dbdb;border-bottom-color:currentColor;border-left-color:currentColor;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:10.4pt;width:211.85pt;">14:30 – 16:00</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#f8eded;border-bottom-color:currentColor;border-left-color:windowtext;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:13pt;width:254.25pt;"><strong>Tuesday</strong></td><td style="background-color:#f8eded;border-bottom-color:currentColor;border-left-color:currentColor;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:13pt;width:211.85pt;">09:00 – 12:30; 14:30 – 16:00</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#f2dbdb;border-bottom-color:currentColor;border-left-color:windowtext;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:13pt;width:254.25pt;"><strong>Wednesday</strong></td><td style="background-color:#f2dbdb;border-bottom-color:currentColor;border-left-color:currentColor;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:13pt;width:211.85pt;">09:00 – 12:30</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#f8eded;border-bottom-color:currentColor;border-left-color:windowtext;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:12.3pt;width:254.25pt;"><strong>Thursday</strong></td><td style="background-color:#f8eded;border-bottom-color:currentColor;border-left-color:currentColor;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:12.3pt;width:211.85pt;">09:00 – 12:30; 14:30 – 16:00</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#f2dbdb;border-bottom-color:#632423;border-left-color:windowtext;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:13pt;width:254.25pt;"><strong>Friday</strong></td><td style="background-color:#f2dbdb;border-bottom-color:#632423;border-left-color:currentColor;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:13pt;width:211.85pt;">09:00 – 12:30</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#f8eded;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-left-color:windowtext;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:currentColor;height:13pt;width:466.1pt;" colspan="2"><strong>Individual Appointments Possible!</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class="table fig-width" style="max-width:619px;"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="contenttable"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color:#9e3a38;border-bottom-color:white;border-left-color:windowtext;border-right-color:windowtext;border-top-color:windowtext;height:34.65pt;width:464.4pt;" colspan="2"><strong>Academic Calendar Spring Semester 2027</strong></td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#cccccc;border-bottom